  "brief": {
    "zh": "带着两副飞蛾面具到东南后台谢幕。南边化妆间的钥匙能开两只道具箱。两台布景车各自绕舞台走一圈，每回合前进一格。道具箱就在车道上。开箱的一回合也要让开布景车。限 66 回合。",
    "en": "Bring both moth masks to the southeast stage door for the curtain call. The key in the south dressing room fits both prop chests. Two scenery carts circle their own stages, moving one square each turn. Both chests sit on cart tracks. Sprout needs a clear turn on the track to open each chest. Finish within 66 turns."
  },
